+------------------------+
                             |   Management LIM       | (Master Load Information Manager)
                             | (Elected Head Daemon)  |
                             +-----------+------------+
                                         |
                                         |  Provides host metrics & load status
                                         v
+-----------------------+     +------------------------+     +------------------------+
|      lsfproxyd        |<--->|       mbatchd          |<--->|        mbschd          |
| (Rate Limiter Gate)   |     | (Master Batch Daemon)  |     | (Master Scheduler)     |
+-----------------------+     +-----------+------------+     +------------------------+
                                          |
                                          |  Dispatches Job
                                          v
                              ( Execution Host Server )

[ USER COMMAND ]
  (e.g., bsub, bjobs)
       |
       v
[ Rate Limiting Gate ] ---->  lsfproxyd  
                                |
                                | (Filters/Protects mbatchd from high load)
                                v
[ Management Host ] --------> mbatchd (Master Batch Daemon)
                                |
                                |--- 1. Asks for load status ---> Master LIM
                                |                                   ^
                                |                                   | (Monitors dynamic metrics)
                                |--- 2. Requests job schedule ---> mbschd
                                |                                   |
                                |<-- 3. Returns scheduled host <----+
                                |
                                |--- 4. Dispatches job to execution host
                                v
[ Execution Host ] ---------> sbatchd (Server Batch Daemon)
                                |
                                |---> Forks: Child sbatchd
                                                |
                                                v
                                             res (Remote Execution Server)
                                                |
                                                +---> Spawns: User Job / Application
                                                |
                                                v
                                             PIM (Process Info Manager)
                                                |
                                                +---> Monitors CPU/RAM & reports back to sbatchd




LSF, daemons, daemon roles, logs, and job lifecycle
LSF architecture & daemons: LIM, RES, mbatchd, mbschd, sbatchd; log anatomy.
Environment & directories: lsf.conf, LSF_ENVDIR, LSB_CONFDIR, LSF_LOGDIR.
Start/stop/reconfigure flows: lsadmin, badmin, lsfstartup; ckconfig, reconfig, mbdrestart.
Raising debug log levels; scheduler profiling basics.
Job lifecycle, states, event/accounting files (lsb.events, lsb.acct).
